  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[MBG/種] Prefers part shade in hot summer climates.\n[NC State/種] It can struggle in our hot southern summers, requiring afternoon shade and moist soils and does best in the mountain region of the state.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or East-facing or South-facing",
